** Pass 0 — Rest

Let the draft sit for at least two weeks. Distance is the only thing that turns
the Creator into the Critic, and there is no shortcut. Write something else in
the meantime.

- Date the draft was put away ::
- Date you may come back ::

** Pass 1 — The dream test

Read the whole manuscript in as few sittings as possible. Mark every point where
you fall out of the dream: you get bored, you get lost, you do not believe it.
*Fix nothing.* Only mark.

Those marks are the roadmap for the eight passes that follow.

*** Marks

